   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **You Wanna Freak Out**: back after 61 archived shows (2059 days) [6]\n- **In Color**: back after 24 archived shows (426 days); rare: 12 archived performances [6]\n- **Thank You Too**: back after 25 archived shows (427 days) [6]\n- **Outta My System**: back after 47 archived shows (1543 days) [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2023-10-24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 22 songs; 134 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **mmj2023-10-24.aud.busman.matrix.flac2496**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 136 min [3]. Said about its sound: Final output is a 24-bit/96kHz FLAC file after alignment and dithering [3]\n- **mmj2023-10-24.oc818.card.sx-r4.flac**: soundboard; 22 songs; 136 min [2]\n- **mmj2023-10-24.CK61**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 22 songs; 136 min [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2023-10-24**: taped by Mark Davidson; transferred by Mark Davidson; source: AKG 460/ck63 (DIN, DFC, SBD) > Zoom F6 [1]\n- **mmj2023-10-24.aud.busman.matrix.flac2496**: taped by Dave V; transferred by Dave V; source: Busman BSC1-K3s A-B 36” + JVC M510 (@ 10’, Right of FOH) > Zoom F8n Pro @ 32/96 [3]. Also: BSC1-K3 A-B 36-inch ribbon mics paired with JVC M510 dynamic mic [3]\n- **mmj2023-10-24.oc818.card.sx-r4.flac**: taped by Ted Gakidis; transferred by Ted Gakidis; source: Austrian Audio OC818(Cards,DIN,DFC,@sbd) > Sonosax SX-R4+(24/96) [2]\n- **mmj2023-10-24.CK61**: taped by Mark Davidson; transferred by Mark Davidson; source: AKG 460/ck61 (DIN, DFC, @SBD) > V2 > Zoom F6 32 (Bit Float) [4]",
